; COMDLG32.DEF
;
; The functions the Windows 98 SE / Me build may import from COMDLG32.dll:
; the import library is made from this list (llvm-dlltool -k), and
; tools/win9x_check.py fails a linked image that imports anything else.
;
; Each name here is exported and implemented by the COMDLG32 of Windows 98
; Second Edition and of Windows Me: the open and save dialogs (the ISO and
; maps folder pickers), ANSI versions.

LIBRARY COMDLG32.dll
EXPORTS
CommDlgExtendedError@0
GetOpenFileNameA@4
GetSaveFileNameA@4
